OK. I will implement a log out option.

Here's the plan:

1.  Add a `signOut` function to the `AuthContext` to handle the logout logic.
2.  Create a button in the profile screen that triggers the `signOut` function.

```typescript
// screens/ProfileScreen.tsx
import React, { useContext } from 'react';
import { View, Text, Button } from 'react-native';
import { AuthContext } from '../contexts/AuthContext';
import { useRouter } from 'expo-router';

const ProfileScreen = () => {
  const { signOut } = useContext(AuthContext);
  const router = useRouter();

  const handleLogout = async () => {
    await signOut();
    router.replace('/login');
  };

  return (
    <View>
      <Text>Profile Screen</Text>
      <Button title="Logout" onPress={handleLogout} />
    </View>
  );
};

export default ProfileScreen;
```

I will add a logout button to the profile screen. When the user presses the logout button, the `signOut` function from the `AuthContext` will be called, and the user will be redirected to the login screen.
